{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98397","id":2137060643,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc5_YPUj","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98397","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98397/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98397/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98397/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1b3e4838991aa2431266b8f0240f207a9f508b6b","number":98397,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add temp utilities (alias `OS::get_temp_dir()`, `FileAccess::create_temp()`, and `DirAccess::create_temp()`)","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR adds `OS::get_temp_dir()`, `FileAccess::create_temp()`, and `DirAccess::create_temp()` functions (the PR originally spelled `tmp` instead of `temp`), for all the supported platforms.\r\n\r\n# The concept of temporary files and directories\r\n> There's already `OS.get_cache_dir()`, why do we need temporary files?\r\n\r\nTemporary files and cache files are really similar, but they are distinct.\r\n\r\n| | Cache files | Temporary files |\r\n| :---: | :---: | :---: |\r\n| Can be deleted at any time by the user | ✅ | ✅ |\r\n| Can be deleted at any time by the OS | ❌ | ✅ |\r\n| Purpose | Persistent temporary files, usually can be expected to be there the next time, useful after creation. | Volatile temporary files, usually not needed after use. |\r\n| Example | Generated thumbnail icons. | One-time write to a file to get the binary data of it. |\r\n\r\nSo this is why Godot should support and provide an API for this special kind of files.\r\n\r\n# Methods\r\n## `OS.get_temp_dir()`\r\nThis function returns the global OS temporary dir for the application. It may be the root `/tmp` directory for most of the Unix/Linux systems, but for other platforms, it is the temporary dir given by the OS.\r\n\r\nIf no such thing as a temporary directory exist for the OS (ie. the Android platform), a directory inside the cache directory is chosen.\r\n\r\n## `FileAccess.create_temp(int mode_flags, String prefix = \"\", String extension = \"\", bool keep = false)`\r\nThis static function returns a `FileAccess` object with a temporary file open. \r\n\r\nFor sorting purposes, you can set `prefix` to the name of your project, just to be able to quickly debug temporary files if needed.\r\n\r\nAs ResourceLoaders usually detect the type of the file with the extension, you can pass a custom extension to add to the file name.\r\n\r\nAnd if you set `keep` to true, the file will not get cleaned up when the `FileAccess` instance will be freed.\r\n\r\n## `DirAccess.create_temp(String prefix = \"\", bool keep = false)`\r\nThis static function returns a `DirAccess` object with a temporary directory open. Useful if you need temporary named files and directories.\r\n\r\n`prefix` and `keep` exist such as in `FileAccess.create_temp()`.\r\n\r\nIf `keep` is false, it will recursively delete the contents of the temporary directory when the `DirAccess` instance will be freed.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color"